        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Nottingham Collection Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nRK International's Nottingham Cabinet Pull is fancy without being gaudy. Each delicate swirl design picks up the highlights of each of the 6 available finishes. It is available in 3 inch, 5 inch, and 8 inch center to centers. The Nottingham Collection Cabinet Door Pull will add a bit of whimsy to your kitchen cabinets, your bathroom vanity drawers, and even your bedroom dresser.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/nottingham-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-155\"><b>Matching Nottingham Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-655:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3 mm</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-656:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 21/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>RKI-CP-657:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 43/64\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-11-specifications.gif?v=1704354548\" width\"376\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" atl=\"RKI International Nottingham Cabinet Pull Finishes\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
